{"n":111,"name":"Al-Masad","nameAr":"المسد","meaning":"The Palm Fiber","ayahs":5,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"تَبَّتْ يَدَآ أَبِى لَهَبٍ وَتَبَّ","en":"May the hands of Abū Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","w":[{"ar":"تَبَّتْ","tr":"tabbat","en":"Perish","root":"تبب","lem":"تَبَّ"},{"ar":"يَدَآ","tr":"yadā","en":"(the) hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"أَبِى","tr":"abī","en":"(of) Abu","root":"أبو","lem":"أَب"},{"ar":"لَهَبٍۢ","tr":"lahabin","en":"Lahab","root":"لهب","lem":"لَهَب"},{"ar":"وَتَبَّ","tr":"watabba","en":"and perish he","root":"تبب","lem":"تَبَّ"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ","en":"His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained.","w":[{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"أَغْنَىٰ","tr":"aghnā","en":"(will) avail","root":"غني","lem":"أَغْنَى"},{"ar":"عَنْهُ","tr":"ʿanhu","en":"him"},{"ar":"مَالُهُۥ","tr":"māluhu","en":"his wealth","root":"مول","lem":"مال"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"كَسَبَ","tr":"kasaba","en":"he earned","root":"كسب","lem":"كَسَبَ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"سَيَصْلَىٰ نَارًا ذَاتَ لَهَبٍ","en":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame","w":[{"ar":"سَيَصْلَىٰ","tr":"sayaṣlā","en":"He will be burnt","root":"صلي","lem":"يَصْلَى"},{"ar":"نَارًۭا","tr":"nāran","en":"(in) a Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"ذَاتَ","tr":"dhāta","en":"of"},{"ar":"لَهَبٍۢ","tr":"lahabin","en":"Blazing Flames","root":"لهب","lem":"لَهَب"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلْحَطَبِ","en":"And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ","tr":"wa-im'ra-atuhu","en":"And his wife","root":"مرأ","lem":"امْرَأَت"},{"ar":"حَمَّالَةَ","tr":"ḥammālata","en":"(the) carrier","root":"حمل","lem":"حَمّالَة"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَطَبِ","tr":"l-ḥaṭabi","en":"(of) firewood","root":"حطب","lem":"حَطَب"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"فِى جِيدِهَا حَبْلٌ مِّن مَّسَدٍۭ","en":"Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber.",